# Workflow Observability Event Schema

Generated by `workflow-observability-spine-spike`.

Minimum event fields:

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": "piwf.event.v0",
  "timestamp": "2026-06-05T00:00:00.000Z",
  "seq": 1,
  "traceId": "trace-run",
  "spanId": "span-1",
  "runId": "run-id",
  "laneId": "optional-lane",
  "actor": "generated-harness",
  "state": "running_lanes",
  "event": "LANE_STARTED",
  "severity": "info",
  "redaction": "public-safe",
  "message": "Human readable summary",
  "artifactRefs": []
}
```

The event log is durable truth. WebSockets, dashboards, PR summaries, and debugger agents are projections.
